 mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VAT_{collected}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是代收后要缴给税局的税，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Commission_{gross}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mmi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 含平台对卖家收的佣金。三者混在一条流水里记账，是跨境结算对不上的主因。工程上必须拆成独立分录：代收税款是<strong>负债</strong>（代税局持有），佣金是<strong>收入</strong>，卖家货款是<strong>应付</strong>。</p>\n<p>汇率是第三个变量。申报通常要求以税局所在货币申报（如 IOSS 以欧元、英国以英镑），而交易以买家本币结算。换汇时点必须固定（多数辖区允许用交易当日或 ECB 月度汇率），且<strong>同一笔交易在开票、申报、退款冲减三处必须用同一汇率</strong>，否则同一个事实会算出三个金额。汇率应与时间戳一样由宿主注入，而非在计算函数里临时读取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现-对账-冲减与审计追溯\">工程实现：对账、冲减与审计追溯</h2><p>代扣代缴系统最容易在&quot;账对不平&quot;处暴露缺陷，难点不在计算，而在<strong>同一笔交易在不同视图里必须互相印证</strong>。至少需要三种对账视图，各自闭合成恒等式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>交易视图 ↔ 税务事实视图</strong>：每一笔支付成功都有且仅有一组税务事实记录。差额常来自&quot;部分退款&quot;&quot;优惠券分摊&quot;&quot;运费单独计税&quot;这些边界场景。</li>\n<li><strong>税务事实视图 ↔ 申报 return</strong>：周期内所有事实的净额之和等于 return 的税基。差额说明有事实落到了周期外，或聚合维表（目的国/税率）不完整。</li>\n<li><strong>申报 return ↔ 缴税记录</strong>：申报额减已缴、留抵、抵扣后应等于门户回执确认的应缴额。差额往往是汇率或申报修正导致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设计上有三条硬约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>税务事实不可变、只能追加冲减记录</strong>。直接 <code>UPDATE</code> 税基会让历史申报无法复现。正确做法是保留原始事实，补一条负向调整事实，用 <code>reference_fact_id</code> 关联。</li>\n<li><strong>申报周期一旦提交，锁定为不可变版本</strong>。修正走 amended return 流程，而非回改原 return。这使&quot;某笔订单在哪个周期被申报过&quot;始终可回答——这也是审计问到的第一个问题。</li>\n<li><strong>卖家侧与消费者侧两张账独立记账、独立对账</strong>。合成一张表求&quot;净额&quot;会掩盖错误：代收税额与佣金收入的差错可能在净额上相互抵消而逃过对账。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对账的时间边界也要显式建模。同一笔订单的&quot;支付时间&quot;&quot;发货时间&quot;&quot;税务归属周期&quot;可能跨月甚至跨季。工程上应把&quot;税务归属周期&quot;作为<strong>显式字段</strong>随事实落库，而不是在生成 return 时用查询条件临时推算——临时推算会在边界日期或时区变化时悄悄错位。</p>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"../einvoicing-standards-data-model/en16931-semantic-data-model\">跨境电子发票数据模型</a> 中&quot;语义模型稳定、语法绑定可换&quot;的原则一致：税务事实的归属周期是语义属性，不该随某次查询的实现方式改变。同样，税率与目的国的取值应来自受版本控制的维表（参照 <a href=\"../einvoicing-standards-data-model/tax-code-category-mapping\">税码与分类映射</a>），而非散落在代码里的字面量——税率随立法变化，字面量会让一次调整变成全库排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>平台代扣代缴把增值税纳税义务从卖家法定转移到平台，工程上因此必须在同一条交易上维护&quot;对消费者 B2C&quot;与&quot;对卖家 B2B&quot;两张独立账。要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>判定逻辑按辖区建模</strong>：欧盟看&quot;单笔货值 + 卖家属地&quot;，美国看&quot;平台自身经济关联&quot;，自变量不同，需按辖区分开建模；<code>ViDA</code> 将持续扩大覆盖范围，配置应表驱动。</li>\n<li><strong>OSS/IOSS 申报是周期性净额聚合</strong>，不是单张发票的导出；退款必须在当期冲减，否则跨期无法配平。</li>\n<li><strong>含税价逆向拆税</strong>用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VAT = P_{gross} \\cdot \\frac{r}{1+r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0987em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，直接乘税率会系统性多算。</li>\n<li><strong>代收税款、佣金收入、卖家货款是三笔独立分录</strong>，混账会让错误互相抵消而逃过对账。</li>\n<li><strong>税务事实只追加不修改</strong>，申报周期提交后锁定，修正走 amended return——保证&quot;某笔订单何时被申报&quot;始终可复现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套机制与开票、申报流水线的接口在于：代扣代缴决定<strong>谁是纳税人和税基是什么</strong>，申报流水线决定<strong>如何把税基可靠地送达税局</strong>。两者正交，但共享幂等与状态管理的工程底座。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台代扣代缴（Marketplace Facilitator）与 OSS/IOSS 申报链路","id":"平台代扣代缴-marketplace-facilitator-与-oss-ioss-申报链路"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：deemed supplier 是一次纳税义务人的法定转移","id":"核心概念-deemed-supplier-是一次纳税义务人的法定转移"},{"level":2,"text":"判定：谁在什么条件下成为 deemed supplier","id":"判定-谁在什么条件下成为-deemed-supplier"},{"level":2,"text":"OSS/IOSS 申报链路：报文结构与数据流","id":"oss-ioss-申报链路-报文结构与数据流"},{"level":2,"text":"税基计算：含税定价下的逆向拆税","id":"税基计算-含税定价下的逆向拆税"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现：对账、冲减与审计追溯","id":"工程实现-对账-冲减与审计追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时/准实时涉税申报流水线的设计与幂等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-einvoicing-digital-tax-reporting/tax-reporting-platform-integration/realtime-ctc-reporting-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"电子发票平台服务商（SDI/IRP/PEPPOL AP）API 集成实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-einvoicing-digital-tax-reporting/tax-reporting-platform-integration/einvoicing-platform-api-integration"}}